{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/_VgbA8l3TGvloThsek4Y4w","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:13.110523+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/_VgbA8l3TGvloThsek4Y4w","html":"<div><section><span><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/dvfL68mw34cZTye7CKtcNIZyRoOzTzgUkeQavUeibn0a7lE8JZThoia7ClcB3fIcwbEkLhibPl27GSKicvLxS9ibvHg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></span></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/AgrnicKbsibHkt2hQ5b8zhE5OYViaQrQqaLgqthzSSdTgfo2J1eakttd1BlT5u8XEcSwERTSMSxvoHKrbNk7vQnp3TLFUalaSCmooC4wIS5un8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>为深入贯彻教育强国建设战略部署，主动服务国家基础教育强师计划与教育强国战略，落实《教育部关于实施国家优秀中小学教师培养计划的意见》（教师〔2023〕5号）文件精神，江南大学2027年继续通过“国优计划”接收推荐免试硕士研究生，现将预报名有关事项通知如下。</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>PART</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>01</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>专项简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>江南大学是教育部直属、国家“211工程”重点建设高校和“双一流”建设高校，长期坚持服务国家战略需求，形成了以轻工、食品、设计等优势学科为引领，理、工、文、教多学科协调发展的办学格局。学校理工类学科基础扎实、特色鲜明，教师教育办学基础良好，教育学科为江苏省重点学科，建有国家级和省级教师教育研究中心、校内教师教育实践教学中心，以及52所优质中小学教师教育实践与研究基地，形成了较为完善的教师教育培养体系。</span></p><p><span>2024年，教育部办公厅发布《关于深入推进实施国家优秀中小学教师培养计划的通知》，进一步推动高水平高校面向中小学培养研究生层次高素质理科和科学教师。江南大学成功入选第二批“国优计划”试点高校，正式承担国家优秀中小学教师培养任务。</span></p><p><span>学校立足“双一流”建设高校办学定位，依托教育学科积淀和理工学科优势，构建“理工素养+教育能力+实践育人”融合培养模式，引导优秀理工科人才投身基础教育。其中，学科专业部分课程由相关培养学院开展，教师教育类课程按照学校“国优计划”培养方案统一组织开设。“国优计划”研究生须修读不少于18学分的教师教育类课程，涵盖教育学、心理学、中小学课程教学、科学技术史等内容，并完成不少于8学分的教育实践；推免选拔入学的研究生实行校内教育学导师组与校外教育硕士导师共同指导的“双导师制”，强化教师专业素养培养与教学基本功训练。教育硕士专业学位论文可采取专题研究论文、调查研究报告、案例分析报告、方案设计报告等多种形式，突出问题导向、实践导向和育人导向。</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>PART</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>0</span></span><span><span>2</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>支持政策</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>教资免试认定</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span><span>“国优计划”研究生享受免国家中小学教师资格考试认定取得中小学教师资格（简称免试认定）改革政策。修完规定学分的“国优计划”研究生，可参照教育类研究生免试认定相关规定，按程序申领中小学教师资格证书。</span></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>专业发展支持</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>鼓励从教的“国优计划”硕士毕业生报考博士研究生，进一步提升专业水平和发展潜力，助力其成长为基础教育领域的骨干教师、卓越教师和未来教育家。</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>专项政策倾斜</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>“国优计划”专项招生入选学生在培养过程中享受专项政策支持，学校将持续完善培养、实践、指导和发展支持体系。</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>学位授予</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>推免选拔入学的“国优计划”研究生，按照培养计划完成课程学习及必要实践环节，成绩合格，通过毕业论文或学位论文答辩，德育、体育考核合格，准予毕业并颁发毕业证书；符合学位授予条件的，授予教育硕士专业学位。</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>PART</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>0</span></span><span><span>3</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>招生选拔</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>我校2027年拟通过接收推荐免试研究生的方式选拔“国优计划”硕士研究生，面向获得推免资格的理学、工学门类2027届本科毕业生，根据国家推免工作安排，于9月中下旬统一完成“国优计划”研究生推免选拔工作。本校或外校预计可获得高校推免资格的应届本科毕业生，均可报名申请我校“国优计划”专项推荐免试研究生。2027年“国优计划”推免选拔招生专业如下：</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/AgrnicKbsibHmKYgCrzmSwbiasE1h3OoUHia0jwghJeeZfuru9J7Ih7zPzGKs8svlQXxyxEVEXIo5sB9mk7L7HXqoO1o5X6WIvU0zEiaLZWMuic5g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><ul><li><p><strong><span>学校、学院可根据生源情况对招生计划进行调整。</span></strong></p></li></ul></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>PART</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>0</span></span><span><span>4</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><ol><li><p><span>申请“国优计划”的学生，须在“江南大学推荐免试研究生预报名系统”进行报名。</span></p><p><strong><span>预报名系统网址：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>http://yzgmis.jiangnan.edu.cn/zsgl/tmsgl/</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>开放时间：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>2026年9月1日至2026年9月17日</span></strong></p></li><li><p><span>我校“国优计划”推免预报名具体工作安排以江南大学人文学院后续正式发布的接收推荐免试研究生工作细则为准。</span></p></li><li><p><span>“国优计划”专项招生后续如有调整，我校将另行通知。未尽事宜，以上级管理部门最新政策为准。</span></p></li></ol></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>PART</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>0</span></span><span><span>5</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><ul><li><p><span>人文学院研究生招生办公室</span></p></li><li><p><span>联系人：李老师</span></p></li><li><p><span>联系电话：0510-85326077</span></p></li><li><p><span>电子邮箱：</span></p><p><span>renwen.admission@jiangnan.edu.cn</span></p></li><li><p><span>江南大学“国优计划”招生咨询QQ群：296451460</span></p></li></ul></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>欢迎广大考生报考江南大学人文学院！</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/AgrnicKbsibHmCBnMzg65Ytib56aDogXMATDSJB80BrN00IIHIIr0x0JehibYlZzLafM4Gabjoh2Zrn0lxuNlcSDFDZ5jT8pQx1qXibVAsuiaglPc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>【关注微语人文 获取更多精彩】</span></strong></span></p><section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><span>-END-</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dvfL68mw34c0f6labXgu17XjxhOETSCCOHg8bZicqqPKxGzXnDxTBualuhob24bOicxym3onzpuMdbfzFDro1LSQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><span><span>信息来源丨江南大学人文学院</span></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>本期编辑丨展文曦</span></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>责任编辑丨安妤婕</span></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>指导老师丨李文文、王振彬</span></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>审核丨王晖、于书娟</span></span></span></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"dda8913f3fb0f8c213a6ebf8fc55684eb1418958a81821ce389fed94b946d377","textLength":1741,"sourceSha256":"5425c7edf226e15d1b113cc8354a12f40d6c13a55c02aa0a1c9f28e6be29ce74","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-0286ffd37634b4c7f0c2","title":"2026年江南大学人文学院2027年“国优计划”推荐免试硕士研究生预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:13.110523+00:00"}
